      </p>
      <p>
        All calculations are done in the 
        <strong>
          OKLCH
        </strong>
         color space, which makes it easier to reason about lightness and chroma independently and to generate scales that behave consistently across steps and different displays. This is especially important for UI work, where
         
        <a
          class="underline"
